/*
  TitleSlide.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0070 · TitleSlide (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TitleSlide` resolves (table "TitleSlide") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog
  at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across
  the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact key extracted from the web source
  (features/analytics/components/review/TitleSlide.tsx → t('yearReview.title', …)). The
  remaining keys back the native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry, the loading /
  empty / error states, the stale + offline banners, accessibility copy).
*/

